  "summary": {
    "en": "The original \"good stuff\" midrange: discard, removal, and efficient threats. Jund taught Modern that every card must earn its slot.",
    "zh": "原教旨「好牌」中速：弃牌、移除与高效威胁。朱特教会近代——每张牌都要配得上牌表位置。"
  },
  "howItWins": {
    "en": "Strip hands with Thoughtseize, answer creatures with Fatal Push and terminate lines, then close with Tarmogoyf, Bob, and Liliana of the Veil.",
    "zh": "用丧心掠取剥手牌，以致命推挤等清除生物，再用塔莫戈夫、鲍勃与帷幕的莉莲娜收尾。"
  },
